{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The bundled HTML exists, exit-interview.json parses with all fields filled, the four report sections appear in an earlier reply, and the grep for TODO/placeholder is clean. But the condition requires every feature in TASK.md to be implemented, and the transcript shows TASK.md was printed only once, in the first command, with no per-feature check against the build. The agent itself reports simplified or reduced features (trophy set-pieces, a smaller critter set, a scripted Snowmoose instead of a full fight), an unverified touch-device layout (a black bar on the title screen was noticed and not investigated), and visual polish called 'rougher' and 'unpolished'. Feature completeness is therefore not demonstrated."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9e576ea7-ae6c-4602-b536-6bfa64a9b891","uuid":"8989422f-c6fc-487d-b305-ddf0856f922b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:17:19.699Z","isSynthetic":true}
